    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Jumping Jacks is a cluster of round bounce pads, each mounted on a coil spring above a square base plate. The pads come in navy, orange, red and sky blue, and they give slightly under a child's weight, so children bounce, balance and jump from one pad to another. Spread across an open patch, the pads become stepping stones in a game of floor-is-lava or a chase between friends. The listed product area is 9'4\" x 4', with a safe play area of 14'4\" x 9'. Colour is listed as Multi Color. Galvanised pipe and roto-moulded parts have 3-year cover, and the springs carry 1 year under our standard warranty terms. Ask us to lay the pads out on your site drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "ProductSpecifications2",
   "props": {
    "pText": "Each spring is bolted to a base plate that is grouted or fixed self-standing to a firm surface. Springs are the wearing part here, so check them for cracks, rust and pinch gaps at every service. Lay rubber flooring between the pads and keep the 14'4\" x 9' zone clear so jumping children do not land on hard edges.",
